@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra API - 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Nop bai hop le - 201
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200718",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/example/edusubmit"
}

### Nop bai khong hop le - 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}